{"id":"rivie_re","lemma":"rivière","pos":"noun","rank":1387,"glosses":["a river (a large, winding stream that flows into a lake, bay, larger river, etc., but not into an ocean or sea)"],"ipa":"/ʁi.vjɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/Fr-rivi%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-rivi%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rivières"},"formAudio":{"rivières":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/37/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-rivi%C3%A8res.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Est-ce là une rivière ?","en":"Is this a river?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Comment pouvons-nous traverser la rivière ?","en":"How can we get across the river?","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to cross, to go across"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Ce chemin suit la rivière.","en":"This path follows the river.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"path, way, road"},{"g":"to follow","l":"suivre"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"La rivière est belle.","en":"The river is beautiful.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"}]},{"text":"Quel est le nom de cette rivière ?","en":"What is the name of that river?","words":[{"g":"which"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"name"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]}]}